{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026beypqyFtcO1794719779.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>黃大仙下邨龍光樓低層單位起火一死，消防：單位內滿布雜物，火警無可疑，死者相信是獨居戶主。</p><p></p><p>【早前報道】</p><p>大火救熄後，消防繼續在涉事單位內射水降溫。</p><p></p><p>警方稱早上8時許接報，黃大仙下邨龍光樓，一個低層單位發生火警，約200至300人要疏散，消防事後在單位內發現一具屍體。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T06:36:36.381446+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T05:12:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T06:50:21.441943+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T06:30:10.250675+00:00","content_hash":"3296c573e73a39e9de444febf724d0ac1cd6f594b48282cac630958df2a0ccee","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-15T06:36:36.381446+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}